{
  "title": "搜索",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>搜索</h1>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">搜索功能提供了多种执行搜索的选项。您可以使用菜单选项、工具栏按钮和搜索模式来执行简单或复杂的搜索。</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Bullet_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <p class=\"Bulleted_list\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><a href=\"#\" title=\"Search Menu\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">搜索菜单</a></p>\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n      <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Bullet_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n        <p class=\"Bulleted_list\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><a href=\"#\" title=\"Search Toolbar\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">搜索工具栏</a></p>\n        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n          <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Bullet_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n            <p class=\"Bulleted_list\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><a href=\"#\" title=\"Search Modes\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">搜索模式</a></p>\n            <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n              <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Bullet_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                <p class=\"Bulleted_list\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><a href=\"#\" title=\"Simple Search\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">简单搜索</a></p>\n                <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Bullet_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                    <p class=\"Bulleted_list\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><a href=\"#\" title=\"Advanced Search\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">高级搜索</a></p>\n                    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                      <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Bullet_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                        <p class=\"Bulleted_list\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><a href=\"#\" title=\"AML Search\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">AML 搜索</a></p>\n                        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                          \n                          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><span data-condition=\"Others:Ignore\"><a data-condition=\"Others:Ignore\" href=\"#\" title=\"Parameterized Search\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">参数化搜索</a></span></p>\n                          \n                          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><a href=\"#\" title=\"Saved Search\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">保存搜索</a></p>\n                          <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Search.htm"
